      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "巧合的是，她和吉兆一样，\n经典级时就在古马级也有参赛的\n“伊丽莎白女王杯”跑出好成绩──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b38776adf54d40d8a6d743c9685f873cb239a526e2c8dd31ca21de543f4df17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
